<title>USA: AMP Q1 shr $0.53, includes $0.07/shr gain.</title>
<headline>AMP Q1 shr $0.53, includes $0.07/shr gain.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISBURG, Pa. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.53		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net		 116,778		  116,448</p>
<p> Net sales	 1,392,867		1,362,975</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  219,931,654	    218,762,121</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The company said its per share earnings includes a $0.07 per share gain from a one-time benefit from accounting changes. Analyst consensus for net earnings per share for the first quarter was $0.46, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
